# Profile: oauth-google
# The OAuth authorization server with Google as the consent-step identity provider.
# Everything up to the external identity provider is exercised; nothing here can
# reach Google (the client id is a placeholder in an unroutable namespace) and the
# scenarios stop at the redirect to Google. See acceptance/README.md.
# The port is the gate's private API port (18199); the issuer URL must equal the URL the run targets
# (the scenarios assert it). If the gate uses another port, change this one line for the run.
NEURALSCAPE_PUBLIC_URL=http://127.0.0.1:18199
AUTH_PROVIDER=google
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_ID=acceptance-placeholder.apps.example
GOOGLE_OAUTH_CLIENT_SECRET=<generate:hex32>
AUTH_ALLOWED_DOMAINS=acceptance-placeholder.example
